# `kernel_rust` is the safe Rust <-> C interface crate: an rlib that every
# other kernel Rust crate depends on.  It holds the graph's only `unsafe`.  The
# kernel's single Rust archive is built by `Cact/kernel/kernel_link`, which
# scans this directory as part of the Rust graph.  Nothing to build here.
